OL,3,GNEWSATemporary footbridge returns to
OL,4,ADarley Abbey
OL,5,
OL,6,FA temporary footbridge in Derby has
OL,7,Fbeen lifted back into place after
OL,8,Fsafety work was completed ahead of
OL,9,Fschedule.
OL,11,FWalter's Walkway was installed on top
OL,12,Fof Darley Abbey Mills Bridge after it
OL,13,Fclosed in May 2022 due to safety
OL,14,Fconcerns.
OL,16,FHowever the prefabricated bridge was
OL,17,Fitself closed in December 2025 due to
OL,18,Ffresh concerns about the 1930s
OL,19,Fstructure underneath before being
OL,20,Flifted out in July to allow the
OL,21,Foriginal bridge to be demolished.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
