OL,3,GNEWSATemporary footbridge returns to
OL,4,ADarley Abbey
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow Walter's Walkway has been put back
OL,7,Fin place by a 470-tonne crane and is
OL,8,Fdue to reopen in mid-November following
OL,9,Fthe installation of new ramps and the
OL,10,Fcompletion of safety checks.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
